# 🚀 Database Partitioning (Sharding)

> **Goal:** Jab database itna bada ho jaye ki **ek single machine usse handle na kar sake**, tab data ko multiple machines mein divide (partition/shard) kiya jata hai.

> 🔥 **Interview Line:** *Replication copies the same data for availability, while Partitioning (Sharding) divides the data for scalability.*

